  "abstract": "This repository includes the metagenome assemblies for the eukaryotic species <em>Ministeria vibrans</em>, <em>Parvularia atlantis</em>, <em>Pigoraptor vietnamica</em> and <em>Pigoraptor chileana</em>. Both the draft and the decontaminated assemblies are included for each species, as well as the corresponding genome annotations for the decontaminated assemblies and the associated protein sequence predictions. As shown in 'methodology.pdf', the draft assemblies were submitted to a comprehensive decontamination pipeline, and hence no contamination is expected neither in the decontaminated assemblies, nor in the corresponding annotations and protein sequence predictions. See the 'README.docx' within each folder for information about the distinct files included within the folder. The raw sequencing data are available at the European Nucleotide Archive (ENA, accession code PRJEB52884).",
